boot.asm is the 8080 based operating system.
It relies on io ports as hooks to tie it into
the c routines in emulator_1.c

diag.asm is a brute force 8080 opcode testor.

ed.asm is an 8080 line editor with hooks to
boot.asm

ramtest.asm is a simple PSRAM test program. Has
hooks to boot.asm

To compile these use the asm80 assembler included 
in this repository, or use your own.

emulator_1.c relies on the file boot.hex (created
by asm80) to run.

